This appendix provides a proof of Proposition 2.10. We start with the expression for fi given in (2.10.12). The first part of the proof is to find an expression that is asymptotically equivalent.

$$\begin{aligned} \sqrt{n}\hat{\gamma}_j &= \sqrt{n}\tilde{\gamma}_j - \frac{1}{n} \sum_{t=j+1}^n}^n (\mathbf{x}_{t-j} \cdot \varepsilon_t + \mathbf{x}_t \cdot \varepsilon_{t-j})' \sqrt{n}(\mathbf{b} - \boldsymbol{\beta}) \\ &\quad + \sqrt{n}(\mathbf{b} - \boldsymbol{\beta})' \left( \frac{1}{n} \sum_{t=j+1}^n \mathbf{x}_t \mathbf{x}_{t-j} \right) (\mathbf{b} - \boldsymbol{\beta}) \\ &\sim \sqrt{n}\tilde{\gamma}_j - \frac{1}{n} \sum_a^n (\mathbf{x}_{t-j} \cdot \varepsilon_t + \mathbf{x}_t \cdot \varepsilon_{t-j})' \sqrt{n}(\mathbf{b} - \boldsymbol{\beta}) \end{aligned}$$

