$$\mathbf{G} = \left[ \sigma^{11} - \left( \frac{\sigma^{12} \cdot \sigma^{21}}{\sigma^{22}} \right) \right] \mathbf{A}_{11} = \frac{\mathbf{A}_{11}}{\sigma_{11}}$$

$$(\text{since } \sigma^{11} - \left( \frac{\sigma^{12} \cdot \sigma^{21}{\sigma^{22}} \right) = 1/\sigma_{11}).$$

