$$y_t = \mu + \sum_{j=0}^{\infty} \psi_j \varepsilon_{l-j} \quad (6.1.6)$$

*converges in mean square.* **{y,}** *is covariance-stationary. (The process* **{y,}** *is called the* **infinite-order moving-average** *process* (MA(oo)) .)

