The nonsingularity of E(x,xi) also implies that condition (b) of Proposition 7.6 is satisfied for probit. It is easy to verify that

$$|\log \Phi(v)| \leq |\log \Phi(0)| + |v| + |v|^2 \quad \text{for all } v. \quad (7.2.14)$$

