$$\frac{1}{\sqrt{n}} \sum_{t=1}^n \mathbf{s}(\mathbf{w}_t; \boldsymbol{\theta}_0) \rightarrow_d N(\mathbf{0}, \boldsymbol{\Sigma}), \quad (7.3.9)$$

then by the Slutzky theorem (see Lemma 2.4(c)) we have

